#: ../../maths/index.md:3 4bcbab6600b647d783b663d7d370f3cf
msgid ""
"These pages give the mathematics behind every number this service can "
"produce. Each one says which wire field feeds which symbol, and where the"
" formula lives in QuantLib's own source, so a claim here can be checked "
"against the code that produced the price."
msgstr "這幾頁說明本服務所能產生的每一個數字背後的數學。每一頁都說明哪個線路欄位餵給哪個符號，以及公式在 QuantLib 原始碼中的位置，因此這裡的每項主張都能對照產生該價格的程式碼查證。"

#: ../../maths/index.md:8 2e0d7142763a4f628651ae33f3937f5c
msgid ""
"Citations of the form `ql/pricingengines/...` are paths inside the "
"QuantLib checkout vendored in this repository at `third_party/QuantLib`, "
"pinned at **v1.43**."
msgstr "形如 `ql/pricingengines/...` 的引用，指的是本專案中以子模組形式放在 `third_party/QuantLib`、固定在 **v1.43** 的 QuantLib 原始碼路徑。"

